<title>USA: Isolyser Q3 shr loss with charges widens.</title>
<headline>Isolyser Q3 shr loss with charges widens.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except for share data)</p>
<p>			   3 mos ended Sept 30   9 mos ended Sept 30</p>
<p>				     1996	1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		   $  42,200$  26,500$ 123,600$  68,500</p>
<p> Gross profit		   10,400    7,400   35,000   20,100</p>
<p> Loss from operations	(6,600)    (900)  (5,000)  (1,200)</p>
<p> Net loss			(7,100)  (1,100)  (6,400)    (400)</p>
<p> Loss per share		 (0.18)    (.03)   (0.17)    (.01)</p>
<p>Weighted shares outstanding</p>
<p>				    38,484   32,625   38,769   34,736</p>
<p>NOTES: Results for the first eight months 1995 do not include White Knight Healthcare Inc acquired September 1, 1995.  Also, results for all periods restated to account for the acquisition of Microtek Medical Inc, acquired in a pooling-of-interests transaction on August 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is Isolyer Co.</p>
